xinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed272461608/1/codegen_prompts/3.md:29:- `Key insight`：解题者需要将两个独立信息源关联起来——迷宫中的分叉颜色和图例中的转向指示。关键在于理解\"左/右转\"是相对行进方向的，而非绝对方向；同时需要从图例的L形箭头中解读出转向含义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:81:Mirror colored sprites using red (2) markers as reflection axes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:88:- Red line within a sprite (vertical or horizontal) → mirror payload across that axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:89:- Single red pixel in a mixed sprite → point-reflect payload around it.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:90:- Isolated red pixel (alone, no payload) → point-reflect each adjacent 8-connected color component.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:91:- Originals remain; mirrored pixels overlay.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:93:Key insight: Red marker geometry (line vs single pixel) determines reflection type; isolated vs embedded red determines what gets reflected.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:180:- The marker positions are not absolute; they label cells of a shared rectangular template, then the labels follow each sprite's rotation/reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:250:- Tile all pieces (rotations/reflections allowed) into a tight rectangle with no gaps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:297:Clean each color layer by enforcing vertical mirror symmetry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:305:- Remove any pixel that lacks a same-color mirror counterpart across that axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1658763150/4/prompt.md:389:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述以及规则总结必须极其详细；语言风格应易于理解；对于特定对象（如箭头），必须在描述中明确其绘制方式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed836347595/3/des.md:39:  - 网格的一个角落（如左上角）有一个小型编码表：表格由若干行组成，每行包含一个颜色色块和紧邻的一个箭头形状。箭头由同色像素构成，形状指示方向——向上的箭头（底部宽、顶部尖的三角形，3 像素宽 2 像素高）、向下的箭头（顶部宽、底部尖）、向左的箭头（右侧宽、左侧尖）、向右的箭头（左侧宽、右侧尖）。每种颜色恰好对应一个方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed836347595/3/des.md:47:- `Key insight`：三层推理——第一层需要识别角落的颜色-箭头编码表并建立映射，第二层需要将种子的封闭区域面积与射线长度关联起来，第三层是执行生长操作。编码表的存在使得颜色不再直接决定方向，必须先\"查字典\"。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:42:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:rotation, object:sprite, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:49:Complete the scene by adding the point-reflected copy of the colored object across the central marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:59:- The center marker is the rotation center; the yellow-looking divider is not mirrored, it only separates the source from the empty target side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:65:  \"transform\": \"copy each source pixel to its 180-degree point-reflection through the center marker, preserving the original pixels, divider, and markers\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:112:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:rotation, object:sprite, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:149:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:rotation, object:sprite, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, relation:between, relation:overlap\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:172:(canonical dr == dc), so it reflects cleanly across all four corner orientations.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/4/codegen_prompts/4.md:177:  \"summary\": \"Colored sprites inside black hollow square frames move to match destination sprites inside other frames via various mirror/diagonal symmetries, with colors transferred\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des