rker value in its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; if that orbit is entirely hidden in the outer strip, use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1807573719/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:355:The marker is not part of the pattern; it covers a missing rectangle whose cells are still determined by the visible mirror or transpose copies elsewhere in the grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1807573719/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:360:  \"src\": \"solid rectangular marker over a mirrored color pattern\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1807573719/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:362:  \"transform\": \"replace each marker pixel by the matching pixel from its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart when that orbit is also hidden\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1336376186/5/codegen_prompts/4.md:19:- 每条连线的中间位置有一个单像素的箭头标记（用 Maroon 色绘制），紧贴连线的一侧：Maroon 像素在连线上方或左侧表示信号从左方或上方节点流向右方或下方节点；在连线下方或右侧表示信号反向流动。箭头标记指示连线的方向性——信号只能从源节点流向目标节点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1336376186/5/codegen_prompts/4.md:23:- 根据 Maroon 箭头标记确定每条连线的方向，建立有向连接关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1336376186/5/codegen_prompts/4.md:29:- 输出中仅节点颜色改变，连线和箭头标记保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed272461608/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:17:  - 每个房间内部恰好有一件\"家具\"——由一种非bg、非灰色的彩色像素组成的小型图案（3-5像素）。家具形状为不对称的，类似于一个箭头或\"L\"形，具有明确的\"指向\"方向。具体地，家具是一个3像素的L形（2x2区域缺一个角），缺角的对角位置所在的方向即为指向方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed272461608/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:42:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:bfs, code:connected_components, object:axis, object:rectangle, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, output:same_size, relation:between, relation:inside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed272461608/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:61:  original object and its reflection to the separator color, then paint the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed272461608/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:62:  reflected object in the source color.\