/eval/seed1328253125/1/codegen_prompts/3.md:365:  \"transform\": \"copy each marker color to its horizontal, vertical, and double-reflection positions; clip reflected positions outside the grid; keep the cross and originals unchanged\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:13:根据网格中箭头形状指示的方向，将同色散落像素沿该方向投射并堆叠到墙壁上，箭头颜色决定哪组像素被投射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:19:- 网格中还有若干小箭头图案。每个箭头由 3 或 5 个像素构成：一个箭头由一个彩色中心像素和从中心向某方向延伸的 1 个同色像素（箭杆）加上垂直于箭杆方向在箭杆末端两侧各 1 个同色像素（箭簇）组成，整体形成 T 形指向某方向。箭头的颜色与某组散落像素颜色相同。每种颜色恰好对应一个箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:22:- 对每个箭头，确定其指向的方向（上、下、左、右）——箭簇 T 形的开口朝向即为指向方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:23:- 找到与箭头同色的所有散落像素点（不包括箭头自身的像素）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:24:- 将这些散落像素沿箭头指向的方向投射：每个像素沿该方向移动直到碰到墙壁或网格边缘前一格停下。若多个同色像素投射到同一列（或同一行，取决于方向），它们依次堆叠在墙壁旁。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:25:- 箭头图案在输出中被擦除（替换为 bg）。墙壁保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed895273084/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:27:Key insight: 解题者需先识别 T 形箭头并解码其指向方向，然后发现箭头颜色将散落像素分组，最后理解投射+堆叠的物理过程——方向解码与颜色分组构成两层非显然的推理。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:41:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:sprite, object:square, object:template, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, operation:shape_match, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:56:- Normalize each main object to its tight mask and compare masks up to rotation or reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1177736933/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:58:- For each off-diagonal table cell, paint a 2x2 red block when the two labeled objects have the same shape under rotation/reflection, otherwise paint a 2x2 grey block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/ev