code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:26:Key insight: 解题者需要 (1) 识别箭头的方向和盖印间距规律；(2) 发现触发器像素引发印章图案变换的规则——不同颜色对应不同的几何变换；(3) 理解变换是累积的——每次触发后印章的新状态会延续到后续所有盖印，而非每次重置。这种状态持续性使得后期的盖印结果依赖于前方所有触发器的累积效果。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:42:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:bfs, code:counter, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:marker, object:rectangle, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, relation:adjacent, relation:direction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:131:overlap_tags=object:grid_edge, object:line_segment, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:adjacent, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:172:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:counter, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, operation:sort_order, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:248:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:counter, object:grid_edge, object:line_segment, object:marker, object:rectangle, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:rotate, relation:adjacent, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:264:- Pack pieces into the rectangle so it is exactly mirror-symmetric (left-right) and same-color pieces never 4-touch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed318830968/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:287:  \"notes\": \"output has exact left-right mirror symmetry; same-color pieces must not 4-touch each other\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed963224475/1/codegen_prompts/1.md:89:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:rotation, object:rectangle, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, output:same_size, relation:adjacent, r