ted pattern to each target quadrant anchored at its red block\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/7.md:371:    \"reflection\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:51:- The grid is a two-color rectangular crop of one rotation/reflection of the same 20x20 motif.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:93:- Pack pieces into the rectangle so it is exactly mirror-symmetric (left-right) and same-color pieces never 4-touch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:350:- Infer the vertical and horizontal reflection axes from the visible (non-zero) pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:351:- For each black pixel, recover its color from the mirrored position across either axis or both.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:352:- When multiple mirrors yield candidates, use the majority color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:354:Key insight: The reflection axes are not given — they must be deduced from the surviving pixels by finding the axes that best preserve the existing symmetry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2068649765/3/prompt.md:399:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述以及规则总结必须极其详细；语言风格应易于理解；对于特定对象（如箭头），必须在描述中明确其绘制方式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1682671888/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:186:- Tile all pieces (rotations/reflections allowed) into a tight rectangle with no gaps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1492500806/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:13:- `Input structure`：背景为 Black 的网格中有若干由 Grey 像素围成的封闭矩形区域（\"保险箱\"）。每个保险箱的一条边上有一个缺口（由 Black 像素中断 Grey 边框形成），缺口的形状是不规则的（如阶梯形、L 形等），这是\"锁孔\"。保险箱内部填充了一个由某种颜色组成的隐藏图案（如 Red 图案、Blue 图案等），该图案被完全封闭在 Grey 框内。网格的另一区域散布着若干小的彩色形状（\"钥匙\"），每把钥匙的颜色与某个保险箱内隐藏图案的颜色相同，且钥匙的外形恰好与对应保险箱锁孔的缺口形状完全吻合（互补匹配：钥匙的凸出部分恰好填满锁孔的凹陷部分）。每把钥匙旁边有一个小的 Maroon 箭头（由 1-2 个 Maroon 像素组成），指示一个方向（上、下、左、右之一）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1492500806/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:14:- `Rule`：首先通过颜色匹配找到每把钥匙对应的保险箱（钥匙颜色 = 箱内图案颜色），并验证钥匙形状与锁孔互补。然后，将保险箱内的隐藏图案沿钥匙旁 Maroon 箭头所指方向平移出保险箱，平移距离等于保险箱在该方向上的边长（即图案完全移出箱体）。平移后的图案绘制到网格上（覆盖 Black 背景）。原保险箱变为空心（内部变为 Black，Grey 边框保留，锁孔缺口被钥匙颜色填充封上）。钥匙本身从原位置消失（变为 Black）。Maroon 箭头也消失。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1492500806/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:15:- `Key insight`：解题者需要完成多层匹配推理：（1）颜色匹配（钥匙色 = 隐藏图案色）确定配对关系；（2）形状互补匹配（钥匙形状与锁孔缺口吻合）验证配对正确性；（3）Maroon 箭头指示图案的释放方向和距离。隐蔽性在于保险箱内图案在输入中已经可见但被 Grey 框\"锁住\"，解题者需要理解\"释放\"操作的空间语义——图案并非原地显现而是沿指定方向弹射出去。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:42:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:output_resize, object:rectangle, operation:count, operation:crop_resize, operation:parity, operation:reflect, relation:direction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:83:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:output_resize, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:rectangle, operation:count, operation:reflect, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:161:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:counter, code:output_resize, object:grid_edge, object:rectangle, operation:count, operation:crop_resize, operation:reflect, output:crop, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:177:- Pack pieces into the rectangle so it is exactly mirror-symmetric (left-right) and same-color pieces never 4-touch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:200:  \"notes\": \"output has exact left-right mirror symmetry; same-color pieces must not 4-touch each other\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/5/codegen_prompts/6.md:211:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:output_resize, code:rotation, object:rectangle, operation:count, operation:crop_resize, operation:reflect, output:crop, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed727231047/