301/3/des.md:56:  - 箭头指向的方向必定是该房间拥有窗口的那面墙的方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2140923301/3/des.md:59:  - 第一步（方向识别）：对每个房间，根据 maroon 箭头的缺角方向确定投影方向（缺角朝上则投影向上，以此类推）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2140923301/3/des.md:60:  - 第二步（内容提取）：提取房间内小型图案的形状（忽略箭头和窗口）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2140923301/3/des.md:62:  - 第四步（清理）：原房间中的图案保留原色不变；箭头在输出中被擦除（恢复为 black）。若投影位置与目标房间中已有内容重叠，投影覆盖已有内容。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed2140923301/3/des.md:64:- `Key insight`：解题者需要同时发现三层关联——箭头方向决定投影去向、窗口位置确定投影入口、窗口颜色决定投影着色——每一层都无法仅靠单一样例确认，必须跨样例交叉验证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:40:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:counter, code:rotation, operation:count, operation:draw_line, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:78:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, object:frame, object:line_segment, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:164:overlap_tags=code:connected_components, code:rotation, object:frame, object:marker, operation:count, operation:draw_line, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:inside, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/1.md:238:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:rotation, object:line_segment, operation:draw_line, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1601781924/5/prompt.md:40:- If the docking orientation uses a reflection, swap the tool's two colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1601781924/5/prompt.md:42:Key insight: Cavity size determines tool–frame pairing; reflection triggers color swap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1601781924/5/prompt.md:392:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述