seed1601781924/5/des.md:89:- `Key insight`：解题者需要先解读箭头方向，再沿该方向追踪路径以确定颜色收集顺序，最后理解条纹的排列方向规则（垂直于箭头且有固定的起始侧）——三层推理中，条纹排列方向的规则最为隐蔽，需要跨多个样例对比才能归纳出\"左手侧起始\"的规律。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:12:Clean each color layer by enforcing vertical mirror symmetry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:20:- Remove any pixel that lacks a same-color mirror counterpart across that axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:82:Replicate a motif across quadrants with scaling and reflection keyed to red anchor blocks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:93:- Align the scaled/reflected motif so its red region overlaps the target anchor, then stamp non-bg pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:95:Key insight: Red block size encodes the scale factor; quadrant position encodes the reflection axes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:332:- The marker positions are not absolute; they label cells of a shared rectangular template, then the labels follow each sprite's rotation/reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:367:- Rotate the sprite (0/90/180/270°) so its contact edge has exactly N-2 contiguous cells aligned with the hub side, and the rotated sprite is mirror-symmetric along the contact-edge axis (UD for left/right, LR for top/bottom).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed58376922/5/prompt.md:399:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述以及规则总结必须极其详细；语言风格应易于理解；对于特定对象（如箭头），必须在描述中明确其绘制方式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/7.md:12:- `description`：将网格中每个彩色\"印章\"图案按其内部箭头指示的方向进行投影，投影长度由印章与同色\"靶标\"像素之间的空格数决定，投影过程中图案逐层褪色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/7.md:16:    - **印章**：小型彩色图案（3x3 至 5x5），内部包含一个由同色像素组成的箭头形状（三角形尖端指向上、下、左、右之一）。箭头之外的印章像素构成\"图案主体\"。每个印章使用独特的颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed101339270/5/codegen_prompts/7.md:17: 