二个箭头的颜色紧接着填内层，依此类推。多个箭头指向同一矩形框时，按箭头离矩形框的距离从近到远排序（近的先填外层）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/8/des.md:31:  - 箭头本身在输出中被擦除（变为背景色）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/8/des.md:32:- `Key insight`：箭头同时编码了三个信息——指向关系（方向）、填充颜色（箭头色）和填充层数（线段长度）。解题者必须先破解箭头的指向目标，再发现线段长度与同心环层数的对应关系，最后理解多箭头叠加时的排序规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/5/similarity_reports/2.json:16:    \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/5/similarity_reports/2.json:69:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/5/similarity_reports/2.json:136:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/5/similarity_reports/2.json:205:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/similarity_reports/3.json:14:    \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/similarity_reports/3.json:50:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/similarity_reports/3.json:97:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/similarity_reports/3.json:146:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/similarity_reports/3.json:189:        \"operation:reflect\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:45:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:output_resize, object:rectangle, operation:crop_resize, operation:parity, operation:reflect, relation:direction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:86:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:output_resize, code:rotation, object:marker, operation:parity, operation:reflect, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:93:Complete the scene by adding the point-reflected copy of the colored object across the central marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/4/codegen_prompts/6.