l reflection orbit; if that orbit is entirely hidden in the outer strip, use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/codegen_prompts/5.md:246:The marker is not part of the pattern; it covers a missing rectangle whose cells are still determined by the visible mirror or transpose copies elsewhere in the grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/codegen_prompts/5.md:251:  \"src\": \"solid rectangular marker over a mirrored color pattern\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1581496934/1/codegen_prompts/5.md:253:  \"transform\": \"replace each marker pixel by the matching pixel from its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart when that orbit is also hidden\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/5/codegen_prompts/3.md:336:- Every non-singleton red object has exactly one reflection symmetry category:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/5/codegen_prompts/3.md:347:label for the object's reflection symmetry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1997776522/5/codegen_prompts/3.md:353:  \"transform\": \"delete singleton red pixels; recolor each larger object in place by its reflection symmetry: horizontal blue, vertical green, diagonal pink\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:93:description：网格中多个 chevron 箭头各自沿指向方向移动，移动距离等于箭头尾部所在行或列中与箭头同色的边缘标记点数量，箭头经过的路径被涂为 grey 轨迹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:97:- 网格中有若干个由不同颜色绘制的\"箭头\"对象。每个箭头由一个 3×3 的 chevron 形状构成，指向上、下、左、右四个方向之一。具体绘制方式（以向右箭头为例）：左列三个像素全涂色，中列仅中间一个像素涂色，右列仅中间一个像素涂色——构成指向右侧的尖角形。向上、向左、向下的箭头分别为该形状顺时针旋转 90°、180°、270° 的版本。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:98:- 网格的最外圈边缘行和边缘列上散布着一些单像素标记点，颜色与某些箭头颜色相同。这些标记点不与任何箭头直接相邻。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:101:- 第一步（确定移动距离）：对于每个箭头，找到箭头的\"尾部边\"（与指向方向相反的那一侧，即向右箭头的尾部边为其最左列）。确定尾部边中心像素所在的行号（若箭头水平指向）或列号（若箭头垂直指向）。计算该行或该列的最外圈边缘上与箭头同色的标记点数量 D。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:102:- 第二步（移动箭头）：将箭头沿其指向方向整体平移 D 个像素。清除箭头原始位置的像素。若箭头移出网格边界，则仅绘制仍在网格内的部分像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:103:- 第三步（绘制轨迹）：箭头原始位置与新位置之间、不属于新箭头的空出区域，全部涂为 grey。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed174941624/11/des.md:106:Key insight：解题者需要先识别 3×3 chevron 形状为箭头并判断其朝向，然后发现移动距离的编码方式——不是箭头自身的大小或颜色编号，而是与箭头同色的、位于箭头尾部行/列边缘的标记点数量。这需要跨越\"空间位置\"和\"计数\"两个维度进行关联推理。轨迹颜色统一为 grey 而非箭头本身颜色是额外需要归纳的细节。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:38:- Infer the vertical and horizontal reflection axes from the visible (non-zero) pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:39:- For each black pixel, recover its color from the mirrored position across either axis or both.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:40:- When multiple mirrors yield candidates, use the majority color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:42:Key insight: The reflection axes are not given — they must be deduced from the surviving pixels by finding the axes that best preserve the existing symmetry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:272:- The marker positions are not absolute; they label cells of a shared rectangular template, then the labels follow each sprite's rotation/reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed859803968/4/prompt.md:391:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述以及规则总结必须极其详细；语言风格应易于理解；对于特定对象（如箭头），必须在描述中明确其绘制方式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed365232737/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:232:Reveal the rectangular patch hidden by the solid marker using the grid's reflection symmetries.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed365232737/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:236:- The visible pattern has horizontal and vertical reflection symmetry on a large lower/right strip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed365232737/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:237:- The top and left outer strips also expose transpose counterparts for cells not recoverable by those reflections.\n/h