e, Maroon] 列表中靠前的那个）。多个箭头可以链式合并成一个整体。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/des.md:48:  - 第三层推理——绘制输出：在右半区域中，对于每个合并后的连通组合体，将其最终形状（包含所有合并箭头的像素）以合并后的颜色绘制到右半区域的镜像位置（左右镜像翻转）。未参与任何碰撞的孤立箭头不出现在右半区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/des.md:51:- `Key insight`：箭头的方向同时编码了运动方向和碰撞的因果链；合并颜色由面积主导而非由碰撞顺序决定；只有发生碰撞的箭头组才会在右侧镜像出现，这是筛选条件而非简单复制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:260:- Pack pieces into the rectangle so it is exactly mirror-symmetric (left-right) and same-color pieces never 4-touch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:283:  \"notes\": \"output has exact left-right mirror symmetry; same-color pieces must not 4-touch each other\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/4/prompt.md:28:(canonical dr == dc), so it reflects cleanly across all four corner orientations.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/4/prompt.md:137:- The marker positions are not absolute; they label cells of a shared rectangular template, then the labels follow each sprite's rotation/reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/4/prompt.md:197:- The grid is a two-color rectangular crop of one rotation/reflection of the same 20x20 motif.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/4/prompt.md:396:4. 生成的问题描述旨在促进后续用于创建题目网格的代码生成。因此，对输入 / 输出网格的描述以及规则总结必须极其详细；语言风格应易于理解；对于特定对象（如箭头），必须在描述中明确其绘制方式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed948739923/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:146:- Normalize each main object to its tight mask and compare masks up to rotation or reflection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed948739923/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:148:- For each off-diagonal table cell, paint a 2x2 red block when the two labeled objects have the same shape under rotation/reflection, otherwise paint a 2x2 grey block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/5/prompt.md:109:- Tile all pieces (rotations/reflections allowed) into a tight rectangle with no gap