止的顺序处理（即先停止离阻挡最近的箭头，再移动其余箭头）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:22:  - 第二层推理——碰撞合并：如果箭头 A 的尖端最终与箭头 B 的某像素四连通相邻，则 A 和 B\"合并\"。合并后的组合体颜色取两者中面积较大者的颜色（若面积相同，取颜色在 [Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Magenta, Orange, Azure, Maroon] 列表中靠前的那个）。多个箭头可以链式合并成一个整体。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:23:  - 第三层推理——绘制输出：在右半区域中，对于每个合并后的连通组合体，将其最终形状（包含所有合并箭头的像素）以合并后的颜色绘制到右半区域的镜像位置（左右镜像翻转）。未参与任何碰撞的孤立箭头不出现在右半区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:26:- `Key insight`：箭头的方向同时编码了运动方向和碰撞的因果链；合并颜色由面积主导而非由碰撞顺序决定；只有发生碰撞的箭头组才会在右侧镜像出现，这是筛选条件而非简单复制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:79:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:connected_components, code:counter, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, operation:translate, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:209:overlap_tags=object:grid_edge, object:line_segment, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:sort_order, relation:adjacent, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:337:overlap_tags=code:bbox, code:bfs, code:counter, code:rotation, object:grid_edge, object:marker, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, operation:translate, relation:adjacent, relation:direction\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:40:overlap_tags=code:connected_components, code:rotation, object:axis, object:sprite, operation:count, operation:reflect, output:same_size, relation:direction, relation:row_col\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:51:- One foreground color forms exactly one full row, column, main diagonal, or anti-diagonal reflection axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1570984732/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:57:- R